# Normalize line endings in the repository so local checkouts and CI agree.
#
# This matters most for the src/ -> packages/ move: without it, core.autocrlf
# rewrites every one of those files on checkout and the migration commit
# carries thousands of spurious line-ending changes that bury the real moves.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Native/binary files must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.node binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary